  "goal": "Plan and implement a simple deterministic adaptive multi-pulse V3 encoder velocity estimator that preserves raw signed pulse count and distance, separates measurement uncertainty from encoder device health, validates source-first with existing captures, and only then runs an authorized 0.15 m/s live motion test with fail-closed safety.",
